chunks.content:
Pull the newest run log for each backup job:

SQL run log:
Get-ChildItem C:\Backups\Logs -Filter "Wasabi-SQL-Backup_*.log" | Sort-Object LastWriteTime -Descending | Select-Object -First 1 | ForEach-Object { "RUNLOG: $($_.FullName)"; Get-Content $_.FullName -Tail 120 }

Websites run log:
Get-ChildItem C:\Backups\Logs -Filter "Website-Backup_*.log" | Sort-Object LastWriteTime -Descending | Select-Object -First 1 | ForEach-Object { "RUNLOG: $($_.FullName)"; Get-Content $_.FullName -Tail 120 }

Files backup bootstrap log:
Get-ChildItem C:\Logs -Filter "files-backup_simple_BOOT_*.log" | Sort-Object LastWriteTime -Descending | Select-Object -First 1 | ForEach-Object { "BOOTLOG: $($_.FullName)"; Get-Content $_.FullName -Tail 120 }
